  "caveats": [
    "Generated images: concept art, to be captioned as such; never a capture from the build.",
    "HiBit screens are generated pixel-style art resampled from a 2K output, not authored native 450x600 masters; the logical pixel grid is not exact.",
    "The API returned opaque JPEG; pip-life-stages.png alpha is keyed from a flat white background (see derivation).",
    "First batch: second attempts for L1 and all third attempts were blocked by the API monthly spending cap (HTTP 429).",
    "Second batch (H1 pass C, D1, D2, E1): 7 of the 8 allowed calls; every shot had at most two attempts.",
    "hero-kit.png (pass C) carries the card fix but the edit drifted two Essence labels and the Station subtitle; see README.",
    "caddy-summary-epaper.png is a JPEG-born e-paper mock: four greys to the eye, with faint JPEG chroma and anti-aliased edges, not a literal four-value image.",
    "Third batch (V1-V7, S2, C3): 11 of the 11 allowed calls; V4 and S2 each had two attempts, every other shot one.",
    "v2-sable.png has no leaf crown: the model dropped the three leaves when it added the long ears, and the budget allowed only one variant retry (spent on V4, whose first attempt also lost the leaves and the ceramic treatment).",
    "Variant portraits are separate generations, so relative body size (Bramble +20 %, Thistle -15 %, Moss +15 %) is not measurable across files; the page must scale those portraits itself if size is to read.",
    "The variants' background came back as a flat warm cream near (244,237,224), not the requested #f5f2e9; the -512 RGBA files are keyed from the measured colour. The 1024 files keep the flat background as returned.",
    "station-research-hands.png (attempt 2) has orange corner bumpers where H1's Station has charcoal ones; attempt 1 had the right bumpers but two round Back buttons, a physical-control error, so it was rejected.",
    "tree-preview.png is a check image for species consistency, not a page asset; the homepage composes the tree from the -512 portraits."
  ],
